# WGIS Data Authoring

The canonical guide is `data/DATA_AUTHORING_GUIDE.md`.

- Read `data/PROJECT_STATE.md` before choosing a batch.
- Keep data work batch-based and source-record-first.
- Do not add isolated entries unless explicitly requested as an emergency fix.
- Keep `data/records/**`, `data/entries.json`, `data/curation-batches.json`, and `data/PROJECT_STATE.md` synchronized.
- Use independent Korean summaries and cite reliable URLs.
- Run `node scripts/validate-data.js` before commit.
